001	GEN	005	029	Ezɨ Lamek ghaze, “Fomɨra Ikiavɨra Itir God nguazir kam gasɨghasɨgha ghaze, dagheba deragh an otivan kogham. Eghtɨ kamaghɨn e ingangarir dafabar amutɨ, dagheba deragh otivam. Eghtɨ otarir kam nguazim damutɨ dagheba deragh otivtɨ e tong avughsɨ, egh puvɨra ingaran kogham.” Kamaghɨn, Lamek ziam Noa, uan otarim gatɨ.
