001	GEN	007	007	Dughiar kam, Noa uan amuim ko, an otariba uan amuiba ko, aperiam otogh me gasɨghasɨghan koghasa, me kurimɨn aven ghue.
001	GEN	007	008	Ezɨ God Noa mɨkemezɨ moghɨra, asɨzir Godɨn damazimɨn zueziba ko, asɨzir mɨzɨrɨziba ko, kuaraziba ko, asɨzir muziariba, asɨzir igharagha gariba bar, da vaghvagha apurir mam ko amebar mam, pumuning pumuningɨn Noa bagha iza, ghua kurimɨn ghuavanangi.
