001	GEN	016	002	Ezɨ Sarai Abram mɨgɨa ghaze, “Nɨ orakigh, Ikiavɨra Itir God boritam batan nan anogoroke, ezɨ kɨ boritam batan kogham. Ezɨ kɨ nɨn azangsɨsi nɨ mangɨ nan ingangarir amizim ko dakuightɨ, a ti na bagh boritam batam.” Ezɨ Abram Sarain nɨghnɨzim mɨrara ghu.
