001	GEN	016	004	Ezɨ Abram Hagar koma akuizɨ, Hagar navim asangi. Dughiar kamɨn Hagar uabɨra uabɨ gɨfo a navim asangi, egha uabɨ pɨrafa Sarain akaba barazir puvatɨ.
001	GEN	016	005	Ezɨ Sarai kamagh Abram mɨgei, “Hagar nan akaba barazir puvatɨ, kar nɨn osɨmtɨzimra. Guizbangɨra kɨ uabɨ a isa nɨn amuimɨn mɨn nɨ ganɨngi. Ezɨ datɨrɨghɨn a uabɨ gɨfo a navim asangi, egha uabɨ pɨrafa, egha nan akaba barazir puvatɨ. Ezɨ Ikiavɨra Itir God uabɨ nɨ Abram, ko nan mɨgɨrɨgɨaba tuisɨghasa kɨ ifonge.”
001	GEN	016	006	Ezɨ Abram kamaghɨn Sarain akam ikaragha ghaze, “Nɨ oragh Hagar pura nɨn ingangarir amizir kɨnim. Nɨ a gativazɨ, a pura nɨn apengan iti. Nɨghnɨzir manam nɨ a damusɨ, puram a damu.” Ezɨ Sarai Hagarɨn apanimɨn ikia arazir kurabar a gami, ezɨ Hagar arav ghu.
001	GEN	016	007	Egha a gumazamiziba puvatɨzir danganimɨn ghua, egha Surɨn nguibamɨn zuir tuavimɨn itir dɨpar atuimɨn otogha avughsi, ezɨ Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn enselɨn mam a bato.
