001	GEN	024	050	Ezɨ Laban ko Betuel kamaghɨn an akam ikaragha ghaze, “Ikiavɨra Itir God uabɨ bizir kam gamizɨ, ezɨ e mɨgɨrɨgɨaba puvatɨ.
