002	EXO	026	035	Egh ia bretba arɨghamin dakozim isɨ notɨn amadaghan Purirpenimɨn aven inimɨn boroghɨn anetɨgh. Egh lamba afamin aghorim isɨ sautɨn amadaghan inimɨn boroghɨn anesaragh.
