002	EXO	027	001	Egha Ikiavɨra Itir God ua kamaghɨn mɨgei, “Ia akasɨn temeba inigh, egh asɨziba bar isia mɨghɨrir ofa gamir dakozimɨn ingarigh. Eghtɨ an arozim ko an ruarimɨn ababanim, aning vɨrara 2 mita, 20 sentimitan tugh. Eghtɨ an tuirivimɨn ababanim 1 mita 30 sentimitan tugh.
