005	DEU	015	012	Egha Moses ua kamaghɨn mɨgei, “Ia Israelian gumazitam ingangarir gumazir kɨnitamɨn mɨn a givezeghtɨ, a ian ingangaribar amu mangɨ, 6plan azenibar tugh. Egh namba 7ɨn azenimɨn, ia aneteghtɨ a mangɨ.
