006	JOS	020	003	Eghtɨ ian gumazitam, atamakuigh gumazitam mɨsueghtɨ an aremegham, an arɨ mangɨ nguibar ekiar kabar tamɨn modogh ikiam. Eghtɨ aremezir gumazimɨn tav uam a ikarvaghsɨ a burian kogham.
