006	JOS	022	011	Ezɨ Israelian gumazamizir igharaziba bar kamaghɨn oraki, “Rubenɨn anabam, Gatɨn anabam ko Manasen anabar me tuirazimningɨn mam, me en amadaghan Jordanɨn Faner mɨriamɨn ofa gamir dakozir mamɨn ingarigha gɨfa.”
