006	JOS	022	016	“E Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn gumazamiziba bar, kamaghɨn ia mɨgei, ‘Ia manmaghsua Godɨn akam batuegha akɨrim ragha a gasaragha ofa gamir dakozir kam uari baghavɨram an ingari? Ia ua Ikiavɨra Itir God ategha an gɨn zuir puvatɨ.
