007	JDG	007	017	Ezɨ Gideon kamaghɨn mɨgei, “Ia deraghvɨra nan gan, kɨ damuamin arazimra ia uaghan a damuam. Kɨ mangɨ men danganir mɨriamɨn mangɨgh, bizir manam damuam, eghtɨ ia uaghan a damu.
