007	JDG	008	033	Gideon aremezɨ, Israelia zuamɨra ua Godɨn ziam fer puvatɨ. Me mati tuavimɨn amizim tintinimɨn gumaziba koma akua da bagha arui moghɨn, aser Balbar, ziaba fe. Egha asem Balberit atɨzɨ, a men godɨn oto.
007	JDG	008	034	Me Ikiavɨra Itir God, uam a gɨnɨghnɨzir puvatɨ. A men God, a men akurazɨ, men apaniba tintinibar iza me mɨsozir dughiabar, me me abɨni.
007	JDG	008	035	Guizbangɨra, Jerubal, an ziar mam Gideon, a deraghavɨra men akuragha me bagha bizir aghuir avɨribagh ami. Ezɨ me da bakɨnɨghɨnigha, deravɨra Gideonɨn adarazi ikaragha me mɨnabazir puvatɨ.
007	JDG	009	001	Ezɨ Abimelek Jerubalɨn otarim, kar Gideonra, a uan amebamɨn adarazi ko amebamɨn anabamɨn gumazamiziba bar men ganasa Sekemɨn nguibar ekiamɨn ghugha,
007	JDG	009	002	kamaghɨn men azai, “Ia manmaghɨn nɨghnɨsi? Jerubalɨn otarir 70pla e gativagh, en faragh mangam, o? Ia ti gumazir vamɨrara ateghtɨ a en gumazir dapanimɨn ikiam? Ia deraghvɨra nɨghnɨgh, kɨ Abimelek, kɨ ian inivafɨzimra. Ia bizir kam deraghvɨra an gun mɨkɨmtɨ, Sekemɨn gumazir aruaba ian nɨghnɨzim baragham.”
