007	JDG	009	007	Ezɨ Jotam kamaghɨn oregha ghua Gerisimɨn Mɨghsɨamɨn orazimɨn ghuavanabogha men diagha ghaze, “Ia Sekemɨn itir gumazamiziba, ia nan akam baragh, eghtɨ God ti ian akam baragham.
