007	JDG	009	009	Ezɨ olivɨn temem kamaghɨn mɨgei, ‘Manmaghɨn ami? Nan borer aghuim, gumazamiziba zurara a isava, ziar ekiam gumaziba ko asebagh anɨdi. Eghtɨ kɨ uan borer ingangarim ategh mangɨ mati amɨnim va, nan aguaba ko nan dafariba feghtɨ, kɨ bar isɨn mar ikɨ temer mabagh afiragh, ti ian atrivimɨn ikiam? Markɨ. Kɨ aghua.’
007	JDG	009	010	Ezɨ temeba kamaghɨn fighɨn temem mɨgei, ‘E kamaghɨn ifonge, nɨ en Atrivimɨn otivam!’
007	JDG	009	011	Ezɨ fighɨn temem kamaghɨn men akam ikaragha ghaze, ‘Manmagh su? Kɨ ti uan dagher isɨngtɨzim ategh nan aguaba ko nan dafariba na feghtɨ kɨ bar isɨn mar ikɨ, temer igharazibagh afirazɨ moghɨn ia bagh atrivimɨn otogham? Bar puvatɨgham.’
007	JDG	009	012	Kamagh, temeba ghua wainɨn ikarɨzimɨn azara, ‘Nɨ izɨ en atrivimɨn otivam.’
007	JDG	009	013	Ezɨ wainɨn ikarɨzim ghaze, ‘Manmaghɨn ami? Nan wainɨn dɨpam bar dera, egha aseba ko gumazibagh amima me bar akonge. Kɨ ti ua wainɨn dɨpam damuan koghtɨ, nan aguaba ko nan dafariba na feghtɨ kɨ bar isɨn mar ikɨ, mati amɨnim dagh ivai da temer igharazibagh afirazɨ moghɨn, kɨ ia bagh atrivimɨn otogham? Markiam.’
007	JDG	009	014	Ezɨ temeba abuan ghua temer dozir dɨkoniba itir mamɨn azara, ‘Nɨ ti en atrivimɨn ikiam?’
007	JDG	009	015	Ezɨ temer dozir dɨkoniba itim kamaghɨn mɨgei, ‘Kɨ ian atrivimɨn otivsɨ, ia guizbangɨra ifongegh, bar moghɨra izɨ nan aguabar apengan orangtɨzimɨn ikɨ. Ia aghuaghtɨ, avim nan aguabar otogh izɨva Lebanonɨn sidan temer ruariba bar dar isigham.’”
007	JDG	009	016	Egha Jotam ua kamaghɨn mɨgei, “Ia Abimelek amɨsevezɨ a ian atrivimɨn otozir dughiamɨn, ia ghaze ia guizbangɨra bar arazir bar aghuim gami? Jerubal uan adarazi ko ian akurazir ingangarir aghuim gami. Ezɨ ia arazir aghuitamɨn a gami, o pu? Ti puvatɨ.
007	JDG	009	017	Nan afeziam Gideon ian akurvaghasa uabɨ isa apanibagh anɨga mɨdorozim gami. A uabɨ mɨdorozir gumazibar dapanimɨn otogha, Midiania ko mɨsogha men gavgavim da ua ia ini.
007	JDG	009	018	Ezɨ datɨrɨghɨn, ia arazir kuramɨn a gamigha an adarazigh gasɨghasɨki. Ia dagɨar dafar mam gisɨn an 70plan otaribav soghezɨ, me ariaghire. Ezɨ gumazir kam Abimelek, ia a gamizɨma, a Sekemɨn gumazir dapanibar atrivimɨn oto. A guizɨn Jerubalɨn amuimɨn otarim pu. Puvatɨ. A Jerubalɨn ingangarir amizir kɨnim otezir borim. Ezɨ ia ghaze, a ian anabamɨn adarasi, egha anemɨsevezɨ a ian atrivimɨn otivasa.
007	JDG	009	019	Ezɨ ia Sekemɨn gumazir dapaniba, ia Jerubal ko an adarazi gamizir arazir kam, a guizbangɨra deraghtɨ, ia Abimelek bagh bar akongegh, eghtɨ a uaghan ia ko bar akongegham.
