007	JDG	015	011	Ezɨ Judabar 3,000plan gumaziba Samson bagha Etamɨn dagɨar akɨriam iti naghɨn ghuaghira kamaghɨn a mɨgei, “Nɨ kamaghɨn fo, Filistiaba e gativagha gɨfa? Nɨ tizim bagha osɨmtɨzir dafar kam gamigha osɨmtɨzim e ganɨngi?” Ezɨ a kamaghɨn me mɨgei, “Me na gamizir arazimra kɨ a ikarvagha me gami.”
