010	2SA	003	008	Apner akar kam baregha atara bar osemegha ghaze, “Nɨ ghaze, kɨ ti nɨn afiar gumazim? Egha nɨ ghaze, kɨ ti Judabar akurvasi? Puvatɨ. Nɨ nɨghnɨgh. Dughiar nɨn afeziam Sol atrivimɨn ikia iza datɨrɨghɨn, kɨ a ko an aveghbuaba ko an namakabar gɨn zui. Egha kɨ uaghan nɨ ataghizɨ, Devit nɨ inigha nɨ gasɨghasɨghizir puvatɨ. Ezɨ nɨ datɨrɨghɨn amizir kam bagha akam na gasi, kar pura bizir kɨnim.
010	2SA	003	009	Ikiavɨra Itir God, Devit bagha Akar Gavgavir mam akɨrigha ghaze, Devit Solɨn adarazi batueghtɨma, me Israelian atrivibar ikian kogham. Ikiavɨra Itir God ghaze, a uabɨ Devit damightɨ a Israelia ko Judabar atrivimɨn ikɨva, kantrin kam bar a gativagham. Eghtɨ Devit kantrin kamɨn atrivimɨn ikɨ, egh Danɨn anabamɨn nguazimɨn ikegh mangɨ nguibar ekiam Berseban tugham. God Devit bagha dɨkɨrɨzir Akar Gavgavir kam bagh, kɨ Devitɨn akuraghan koghtɨ, God na mɨsueghtɨ kɨ aremegham.”
