010	2SA	003	015	Ezɨ Isboset kamaghɨn oregha gumazir maba amangizɨma, me ghua Laisɨn otarim Paltiel, a Mikalɨn pam, me ada Mikal inigha Devit bagha ize.
010	2SA	003	016	Me Mikal inigha Devit bagha zuir dughiamɨn, Paltiel aziava Mikalɨn gɨn zui. Me ghua Bahurimɨn nguibar ekiamɨn otogha, Apner kamaghɨn Paltiel mɨgei, “Nɨ uamategh uan dɨpenimɨn mangɨ.” Ezɨ Paltiel an akam baregha uamatenge.
