010	2SA	003	035	Bizir kabar gɨn, gumazamiziba Devit mɨgɨa ghaze, aruem ikiavɨra iti, nɨ daghetam amɨ. Ezɨ an aghuagha akar gavgavir mamɨn me mɨgɨa ghaze, “Kɨ daghetam ameghan kogh ikɨ mangɨ guaratɨzimɨn tugham. Aruem tɨghar magɨrɨtɨ kɨ daghetam ameghtɨ, God na mɨsueghtɨ kɨ aremegham.”
