010	2SA	004	004	Solɨn otarim Jonatan, an otarir vamɨra iti, an ziam Mefiboset. Mefiboset 5plan azeniba itima, Sol ko Jonatan areme. Dughiar kamɨn, Jesrilɨn nguibar ekiamɨn gumaziba, me Jonatanɨn adarazi bagha akam amaga ghaze, Jonatanɨn apaniba a mɨsoghezɨma an areme. Ezɨ an adarazi akar kam baraki, ezɨ amizir Mefibosetɨn garim a inigha arav ghu. Amizim pamtemɨn ivemarima, Mefiboset degiaghirɨ, egha datɨrɨghɨn an dagarimning an ikufi.
