011	1KI	008	041	“Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamiziba, me nɨn adarazi Israelian aven itir puvatɨ, egh me nɨn ziam bangɨn, uan nguibar saghon itiba ategh kagh izam. Guizbangɨra, me nɨn ziar ekiam ko, ingangarir bar ekiar nɨ en gumazamizibar akurvaghasa amiziba, me da baraki. Egh men tarazi, nɨn ziam fɨsɨ, nɨn Dɨpenir kamɨn boroghɨra izɨ, egh nɨ ko mɨkɨmam.
011	1KI	008	043	O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ uan Nguibamɨn iti, egh nɨ men dɨmdiam baragh, egh bizir me damuasa nɨn azangsɨzibar amu. Kamaghɨn amizɨ, e Israelia, nɨn gumazamiziba, e ami moghɨn, nguazir kamɨn gumazamiziba bar nɨ gɨfogh egh nɨn atiating nɨn apengan ikiam. Egh me fogh suam, Dɨpenir kɨ ingarizir kam, kar nɨn Dɨpenimra, eghtɨ an aven nguazir kamɨn gumazamiziba me nɨn boroghɨra izam.
