012	2KI	004	003	Ezɨ Elisa kamaghɨn a mɨgei, “Nɨ mangɨ namakabar azaraghtɨ, me uan mɨner pura itiba nɨ danɨngigh. Nɨ mɨner avɨriba inigh.
