012	2KI	004	013	Ezɨ Elisa Gehasi mɨgɨa ghaze, “Nɨ kamaghɨn amizimɨn azaragh, ‘Bar guizbangɨra, nɨ ingangarir ekiam gamua gan akura. E bizir tizim damigh, nɨn akurvazir aghuim ikaragham? Elisa ti mangɨ atrivim o mɨdorozir gumazibar dapanimɨn azaraghtɨ, aning nɨ bagh bizir aghuitam damuam? Nɨ kamaghɨn ifongez, o?’” Ezɨ Gehasi ghua amizir kamɨn azarazɨ, amizim kamaghɨn a mɨgei, “Kɨ uan adarazir tongɨn iti, egha bizitamɨn otevezir puvatɨ.”
