012	2KI	004	015	Ezɨ Elisa Gehasi mɨgɨa ghaze, “Nɨ amizim mɨkemeghtɨ, a izɨ.” Ezɨ Gehasi ghua amizim mɨkemezɨ, a iza tiar akamɨn tughav iti.
012	2KI	004	016	Ezɨ Elisa amizim mɨgɨa ghaze, “Azenir munamɨn dughiar kamra, nɨ otaritam uan agharimningɨn a firagham.” Ezɨ amizim a ikaragha ghaze, “Ga uaning, nan gumazir aruam, nɨ Godɨn akam akurir gumazim, nɨ na gifaran markɨ.”
