012	2KI	004	023	Ezɨ an pam ghaze, “Manmagh amizɨ nɨ datɨrɨghɨra mangasa? Nɨ Sabatɨn dughiam o iakɨnir igiamɨn dughiar ekiam mɨzuamam, o?” Ezɨ amizim ghaze, “Markɨ, kɨ datɨrɨghɨra mangasa. Nɨ nɨmɨra ikɨ. Biziba deragham.”
