012	2KI	008	013	Ezɨ Hasael akar kam baregha, kamaghɨn Elisan akam ikaragha ghaze, “Kɨ pura gumazir kɨnim. Kɨ manmaghɨn bizir ekiar kam damuam?” Ezɨ Elisa kamaghɨn a mɨgei, “Ikiavɨra Itir God kamaghɨn nan akagha gɨfa, nɨ Sirian atrivimɨn otivam.”
