012	2KI	019	010	Senakerip kamaghɨn akɨnafarim osiri, “Hesekia, kɨ fo, Godɨn nɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim itim, a nɨ mɨgɨa ghaze, kɨ mɨsogh ia abɨnigh Jerusalem inighan kogham. A nɨ gifari. Nɨ bar an akam baraghan markɨ.
