013	1CH	006	009	ezɨ Ahimas, a Asarian afeziam, ezɨ Asaria, a Johananɨn afeziam,
013	1CH	006	010	ezɨ Johanan, a Asarian igharazimɨn afeziam. Atrivim Solomon Jerusalemɨn Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn ingarizir dughiamɨn, Asarian igharazir kam ofa gamir gumazibar dapanimɨn iti.
013	1CH	006	011	Ezɨ Asarian kam, a Amarian afeziam, ezɨ Amaria, a Ahitupɨn afeziam,
013	1CH	006	012	ezɨ Ahitup, a Sadokɨn afeziam, ezɨ Sadok, a Salumɨn afeziam,
013	1CH	006	013	ezɨ Salum, a Hilkian afeziam, ezɨ Hilkia, a Asarian afeziam,
013	1CH	006	014	ezɨ Asaria, a Seraian afeziam, ezɨ Seraia, a Jehosadakɨn afeziam.
013	1CH	006	015	Ezɨ Ikiavɨra Itir God nɨghnɨzim isava Atrivim Nebukatnesar ganɨngizɨma, Babilonia izava Judaba ko Jerusalemia inigha kalabuziabar mɨn me inigha ghue. Dughiar kamɨn me uaghan kalabuziar gumazimɨn mɨn, Jehosadak inigha Babilonɨn ghu.
013	1CH	006	016	Livain otaribar ziabar kara: Gerson, Kohat ko Merari.
013	1CH	006	017	Ezɨ Gersonɨn otarimningɨn ziamning kara: Lipni ko Simei.
013	1CH	006	018	Ezɨ Kohatɨn otaribar ziabar kara: Amram, Ishar, Hebron ko Usiel.
013	1CH	006	019	Ezɨ Merarin otarimningɨn ziamning: Mali ko Musi. Gumazir kaba, Livain anabamɨn ikɨzibar gumaziba.
013	1CH	006	020	Ezɨ Gersonɨn ikɨzimɨn ovavir boribar ziabar kara: Gerson, a Lipnin afeziam, ezɨ Lipni, a Jahatɨn afeziam, ezɨ Jahat, a Siman afeziam,
013	1CH	006	021	ezɨ Sima, a Joan afeziam, ezɨ Joa, a Idon afeziam, ezɨ Ido, a Seran afeziam, ezɨ Sera, a Jeaterain afeziam.
013	1CH	006	022	Ezɨ Kohatɨn ovavir boribar ziabar kara: Kohat, an Aminadapɨn afeziam, ezɨ Aminadap, a Koran afeziam, ezɨ Kora, a Asirɨn afeziam,
013	1CH	006	023	ezɨ Asir, a Elkanan afeziam, ezɨ Elkana, a Ebiasapɨn afeziam, ezɨ Ebiasap, a Asirɨn igharazimɨn afeziam,
013	1CH	006	024	ezɨ Asir, a Tahatɨn afeziam, ezɨ Tahat, a Urielɨn afeziam, ezɨ Uriel, a Usian afeziam, ezɨ Usia, a Saulɨn afeziam.
013	1CH	006	025	Ezɨ Elkanan ovavir boribar ziabar kara: Amasai, Ahimot,
013	1CH	006	026	ko Elkana. Ezɨ Elkanan igharazir kamɨn ovavir boribar kara: Elkana, a Sofain afeziam, ezɨ Sofai, a Nahatɨn afeziam,
013	1CH	006	027	ezɨ Nahat, a Eliapɨn afeziam, ezɨ Eliap, a Jerohamɨn afeziam, ezɨ Jeroham, a Elkanan afeziam.
013	1CH	006	028	Ezɨ Samuelɨn otarimningɨn ziamning kara: Joel an otarir ivariam, ezɨ an gɨrara irim Abiya.
013	1CH	006	029	Ezɨ Merarin ikɨzimɨn ovavir boribar ziabar kara: Merari, a Malin afeziam, ezɨ Mali, a Lipnin afeziam, ezɨ Lipni, a Simein afeziam, ezɨ Simei, a Usan afeziam,
013	1CH	006	030	ezɨ Usa, a Simean afeziam, ezɨ Simea, a Hagian afeziam, ezɨ Hagia, a Asaian afeziam.
013	1CH	006	031	Ezɨ Atrivim Devit Akar Dɨkɨrɨzir Gavgavimɨn Boksiam inigha iza, Jerusalemɨn Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn aven izegha anetɨgha gɨvagha, Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn aven onger akabar ingangarimɨn faragh mangamin gumazir maba amɨsefe.
013	1CH	006	032	Ezɨ gumazamiziba bar uari akuvir dughiamɨn, gumazir kaba Ikiavɨra Itir God bativamin Purirpenimɨn tiar akamɨn boroghɨn ighiabagh ami. Me Godɨn Purirpenim boroghɨn kamaghɨram amua ghua, Atrivim Solomon Jerusalemɨn itir Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Dɨpenir igiamɨn ingari. Gumazir kaba, bar deravɨra Godɨn Akɨnafarimɨn aven onger akabar amuamin arazibar gɨntɨsi.
013	1CH	006	033	Devit ighiabar amuamin gumazibar faragh mangamin gumazir 3pla amɨsefe. Eghtɨ men boriba gɨn kamaghɨra ingangarir kam damuam. Kohatɨn ikɨzimɨn gumazim men fara, an ziam Heman. An onger akabar araziba bar adagh fo. Heman, a Joelɨn otarim, ezɨ Joel, a Samuelɨn otarim,
013	1CH	006	034	ezɨ Samuel, a Elkanan otarim, ezɨ Elkana, a Jerohamɨn otarim, ezɨ Jeroham, a Elielɨn otarim, ezɨ Eliel, a Toan otarim,
013	1CH	006	035	ezɨ Toa, a Sufɨn otarim, ezɨ Suf, a Elkanan otarim, ezɨ Elkana, a Mahatɨn otarim, ezɨ Mahat, a Amasain otarim,
013	1CH	006	036	ezɨ Amasai, a Elkanan otarim, ezɨ Elkana, a Joelɨn otarim, ezɨ Joel, a Asarian otarim, ezɨ Asaria, a Sefanaian otarim,
013	1CH	006	037	ezɨ Sefanaia, a Tahatɨn otarim, ezɨ Tahat, a Asirɨn otarim, ezɨ Asir, a Ebiasapɨn otarim, ezɨ Ebiasap, a Koran otarim,
013	1CH	006	038	ezɨ Kora, a Isharɨn otarim, ezɨ Ishar, a Kohatɨn otarim, ezɨ Kohat, a Livain otarim, ezɨ Livai, a Israelɨn otarim.
013	1CH	006	039	Devit mɨsevezir gumazir namba 2, an ziam Asap. Asap, a Hemanɨn aveghbuam, egha a ko ingangarir vamɨram ami. Egha onger akabagh amir dughiabar, Asap uan adarazi ko Hemanɨn agharir guvimɨn amadaghan tuifi. Asap, a Berekian otarim, ezɨ Berekia, a Simean otarim,
