013	1CH	007	008	Ezɨ Bekerɨn otaribar ziabar kara: Semira, Joas, Elieser, Elioenai, Omri, Jeremot, Abiya, Anatot ko Alemet. Gumazir kaba bar, me Bekerɨn otariba, me bar moghɨra uan adarazir gumazir dapaniba, egha me mɨdorozir gumazir gavgaviba.
