013	1CH	007	021	ezɨ Eleada, a Tahatɨn igharazimɨn afeziam, ezɨ Tahat, a Sabatɨn afeziam, ezɨ Sabat, a Sutelan igharazimɨn afeziam. Efraim ua otarir igharazir pumuning iti, Eser ko Eleat. Ezɨ aning Getɨn nguibar ekiamɨn adarazir bulmakauba okɨmasa uaghirɨzɨma, Getia aning mɨsoghezɨma aning areme.
