017	EST	001	013	Kar atrivimɨn arazim, a fofozir gumazibar azara, kar gumazir faragha zuir dughiabar arazibagh foziba. A men azaraghtɨ, me gumazibar dabirabim ko arazir aghuiba a mɨkɨmtɨ, a fogham. Kamaghɨn amizɨ, a fofozir gumazibar diazɨma me ize, egh me a mɨkɨmtɨ a man arazitamra kwin damuam.
