017	EST	001	017	Guizbangɨra, nɨ garir nguibabar aven itir amiziba, me bar kwinɨn arazir kurar kam baragham. Egh amiziba kamagh mɨkɨmam, ‘Atrivim Serksis Kwin Vasti mɨgɨa ghaze amang an ganam, ezɨ kwin aghuagha atrivimɨn akam batoke.’ Amiziba uaghan akaba batogh uan pabar akaba baraghan kogham.
