018	JOB	036	013	“Gumazamizir nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Godɨn itir puvatɨziba, an osɨmtɨziba me garɨzir dughiabar, me Godɨn anɨngagha, uarir akurvaghasa an azangsɨzir puvatɨ.
018	JOB	036	014	Me aghumsɨzir arazibagh amir gumazamizibar tongɨn ikia, egha igiabaram ovei.
018	JOB	036	015	God gumazamizibagh amima, me osɨmtɨziba ko mɨzaziba isi. Arazir kamɨn, God arazir aghuibar amuasa gumazamizibar sure gami, egha tuavir kamɨn a ua me isi, ezɨ me deravɨra iti.
018	JOB	036	016	“Jop, nɨ gan, nɨ datɨrɨghɨn osɨmtɨzir ekiam atera atam ovenge. Ezɨ God ua nɨ iniasa bar ifonge, egh nɨ damightɨ, nɨ deravɨra daperagh fɨrighɨrɨgham. Eghtɨ a dagher bar aghuiba ko biziba nɨ danɨngam.
018	JOB	036	017	Ezɨ datɨrɨghɨn God nɨn gari, nɨ mati gumazir arazir kurabagh amim, egha nɨ isa kotiam gatɨgha osɨmtɨzim nɨ ganɨngi. Ezɨ nɨ manmaghɨn osɨmtɨzir kam gitagham? Ti puvatɨgham.
018	JOB	036	018	Kamaghɨn nɨ deraghvɨra ganigh, nɨn anɨngagharim nɨ damutɨ, nɨ God dɨpovan markɨ. Egh nɨ ua suam, nɨ uabɨ givezamin ivezim a bar ekefe, egh nɨ God ateghan markɨ.
018	JOB	036	019	Nɨn bizir avɨriba ko nɨn gavgavim, datɨrɨghɨn nɨn osɨmtɨzir kam agɨvaghan kogham.
018	JOB	036	020	Nɨ dɨmagarim otivsɨ puvɨra nɨghnɨghan markɨ, kar gumazamiziba zuamɨra puvarɨghamin dughiam.
018	JOB	036	021	Nɨ faragha arazir kurabagh ami. Bizir kam bangɨn nɨ foghasa, God osɨmtɨziba nɨ ganɨngi. Kamaghɨn nɨ ua bagh ganigh, nɨ uam arazir kuratam bar an aven mangan markɨ.
018	JOB	036	022	“Nɨ deravɨram oragh. God gavgavir ekiam ikia bar pɨn ti. Egha a tisan bar aghuim. Tina ua an mɨn en sure damuam? Bar puvatɨ.
018	JOB	036	023	Tinara God damuamin bizibar a mɨkɨmtɨ, a adar amuam? Egh tina kamaghɨn a mɨkɨm suam, ‘God, nɨ arazir kuram gami?’ Gumazitam kamaghɨn mɨkemeghan kogham.
018	JOB	036	024	Gumazamiziba God ingarizir bizibar gara, egha onger akabagh amua an ziam fe. Kamaghɨn amizɨ, nɨ uaghan an ziam fɨ.
