018	JOB	036	027	A nguazir kamɨn dɨpam isa ghuavanaga a gamima, an amozimɨn oto.
018	JOB	036	028	Egha amozir ofɨziba ko ghuariar overiamɨn itiba, izaghira nguazim gizima, gumazamiziba dɨpar avɨrim isi.
018	JOB	036	029	E kamaghɨn fozir puvatɨ, ghuariar manaba ekevegha overiam avara, mati Godɨn Purirpenim. E fozir puvatɨ, arariba manmaghɨn ghuariabar apengan ikia tɨngazi.
018	JOB	036	030	God onɨmaribagh amima, da tintinimɨn danganiba bar dar taghtasi. Egha ongarir konim avarazɨ, a mɨtarmemɨn aven iti.
018	JOB	036	031	God ghuariaba ko amozibagh atifa, egha arazir kamra a gumazamiziba bar me gativagha deravɨra men gari. Egha amozim gami an azenibagh izima gumazamiziba dagher avɨriba iti.
018	JOB	036	032	An uan dafarimningɨn onɨmarim korogha, afuzimɨn mɨn, bizir a inivasa ifongezim ginifi.
018	JOB	036	033	Arariba tɨngazima, e fo, amɨnim ko amozim otogham. Ezɨ bulmakauba uaghan fogha arazir mabagh ami.”
018	JOB	037	001	“Arariba dagarvazima, kɨ nɨsi, ezɨ nan dɨghorim na ginifi.
