018	JOB	037	012	God uabɨ mɨgeima, ghuariaba ighuagha arui. Da ghua gumazamiziba itir danganibar, God damuasa mɨkemezir bizibagh ami.
018	JOB	037	013	God kamaghsua amozim amadi, dughiar maba a gumazamizibar arazir kuraba akɨrasa, egha dughiar maba, a men apangkuva arazir aghuim me damuasa.
018	JOB	037	014	“Jop, nɨ kuarim atɨgh nɨmɨra ikɨ puram oragh, egh God amir bizir ekiar igharagha garibagh nɨghnɨgh.
018	JOB	037	015	God Akar Gavgavim ghuariabagh anɨngizɨ, onɨmariba dar aven ikia taghtagha tintinibar zui. Nɨ ti kamaghɨn foz, o?
018	JOB	037	016	God overiamɨn ghuariaba guizɨ, da pura guighav iti. A ghuariabagh amir arazir kam, nɨ ti a gɨfoz, o? God fofozir avɨriba ikia, dɨgavir kuram gamir arazimɨn, ingangarir aghuir kabagh ami. Ezɨ nɨ fofozir kamaghɨn garim puvatɨ.
018	JOB	037	017	Nɨ korotiam aruzɨ, amɨnir fefer sautɨn amadaghan izim nɨ gamima, doriba nɨn azima, nɨ bar puvɨra sokosi. Nɨ manmaghɨn amɨnir fefer kamɨn tɨvagham. Bar puvatɨgham.
018	JOB	037	018	God overiamɨn ingarigha, a isa an danganimɨn anetɨzɨ, a ikia gavgafi. Ezɨ overiam mati guabar garir bizimɨn mɨn iti, me brasɨn ganganir kamɨn ingari. Ezɨ nɨ ti Godɨn akuragh kamaghɨn bizitamɨn ingarigham? Bar puvatɨgham.
