018	JOB	038	002	“Jop, nɨ nɨghnɨzir aghuim ko fofozim puvatɨ. Nɨ bar manmaghɨn garir gumazim, egha nɨ fofoziba puvatɨgha tintinibar mɨgɨrɨgɨar avɨribagh ami?
018	JOB	038	003	Nɨ datɨrɨghɨn guizɨn gumazimɨn mɨn tugh. Eghtɨ kɨ azangsɨzibar nɨ damutɨ, nɨ nan azangsɨziba ikarvagh.
018	JOB	038	004	“Jop, dughiar kɨ nguazir kamɨn ingara egha gavgavim an mɨngarim ganɨdimɨn, nɨ managh ike? Nɨ bizir kaba deragh dagh fogh na mɨkɨm.
018	JOB	038	005	Tinara, deraghvɨra nɨghnigha nguazir kamɨn mɨtaghniaba arɨki? Tinara benim inigha nguazir kam garɨgha, an ruariba ko arozibar ababanibagh amuagh arui? Nɨ ti bizir kabagh foz o?
018	JOB	038	006	Gavgavim nguazir kam danɨngamin guarir akɨniba, managh mɨtivighav iti? Ezɨ tinara dagɨar, nguazim isɨn ikɨ, gavgavighamibar ingari?
018	JOB	038	007	Ingangarir kam otozir dughiamɨn, mɨkoveziba an ganigha bar akongegha ighiabagh amima, enselba dia bar akonge.
