018	JOB	038	011	Kɨ ongarim mɨgɨa ghaze, ‘Nɨ ongarir ekiam, nɨ dɨkav bar pɨn mavanang dɨpɨr izɨ kaghɨra tugh. Nɨ mɨtaghniar kam fagh vongɨn mangan markɨ.’
018	JOB	038	012	“Jop, nɨ ti pura mɨgeima amɨnim tira? Nɨ ti dughiabar vaghvagha mɨzarazibar dughiabar bori?
