019	PSA	073	006	Kamaghɨn amizɨ, me uari fer arazir kam mati, me deragha uan mɨkarzibar kurti. Me pura gumazir igharazibav sogha me gasɨghasɨsi. Ezɨ arazir kam me avara, mati me korotiaba isa uan mɨkarziba ave.
019	PSA	073	007	Men nɨghnɨziba ko navibar aven, arazir kurar avɨrir me damuasa ifongeziba otivaghiri.
