019	PSA	073	010	Me kamaghɨn damutɨ, Godɨn gumazamiziba men akabagh ifuegh, nɨghnɨzir gavgavim dar ikiam.
019	PSA	073	011	Gumazir kurar kaba ghaze, “E amir biziba God dagh foghan kogham. Godɨn Bar Pɨn Itim, en arazir e amiba, a tam bativsɨ damuva avegham.”
