019	PSA	077	011	O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ dɨgavir kuram gamir araziba ko, ingangarir ekiar nɨ faragha amiziba, kɨ uamategh dagh nɨghnɨgham.
019	PSA	077	012	Kɨ guizbangɨra dɨgavir kuram gamir araziba ko, ingangarir ekiar nɨ faragha amiziba, kɨ uamategh dagh nɨghnɨgham.
