019	PSA	079	002	Me nɨn gumazamizibav soghezɨ me ariaghirezɨ, me nɨn ingangarir gumazir kabar kuaba isa kuaraziba ko asɨzir atiabar daghebar mɨn dagh anɨngizɨ, da da ame.
