019	PSA	106	026	Kamaghɨn amizɨ, God akar dɨkɨrɨzim me danɨngasa, uan ziam dɨbora ghaze, bar guizbangɨra, a me damutɨ, me gumazamiziba puvatɨzir danganimɨn ikɨva arɨmɨghiram.
