019	PSA	107	016	Me fo, a gumaziba brasɨn gavgavimɨn ingarizir tiaba abɨagharɨgha, kalabuziar dɨpenimɨn ain baba akaragharɨsi.
019	PSA	107	017	Guizbangɨra, ian marazi bar arazir kurabagh ami. Egha arazir kurar me amir kaba bangɨn me arɨmariar kuraba ini.
019	PSA	107	018	Me dagheba inian aghuagha ovengasava ami.
019	PSA	107	019	Men ikɨrɨmɨrim ikuvizɨ me pazavɨra ikia, egha Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn dei. Ezɨ a men akuragha men osɨmtɨzir kam agɨfa.
019	PSA	107	020	A uabɨ mɨgeima, an akar kam men mɨkarzibagh amizɨ da ua dera. Ezɨ a matmatiamɨn ua me ini.
