019	PSA	119	009	Gumazir igiam, a tuavir manamɨn Godɨn damazimɨn zuegham? A nɨn akamɨn suiragh gavgavigh an gɨn mangɨ, egh zuegham.
019	PSA	119	010	Kɨ uan navir averiamɨn aven nɨghnɨzir vamɨran ikɨva, nɨn ingangarim damuasa. Nɨ nan akuraghtɨ kɨ nɨn Akar Gavgaviba ataghɨraghan kogham.
019	PSA	119	011	Kɨ nɨn akam uan navim ko nɨghnɨzimɨn aning gatɨ. Kamaghɨn, kɨ arazir kuratam nɨn damazimɨn a damighan kogham.
019	PSA	119	012	O, Ikiavɨra Itir God kɨ nɨn ziam fe. Nɨ uan arazir ifongezibar nan sure damu.
