019	PSA	119	140	Kɨ nɨn ingangarir gumazim, kɨ nɨn akar dɨkɨrɨzimɨn ganigha a tuisigha fo, a bar guizbangɨra. Egha akar dɨkɨrɨzir kam kɨ bar a gifonge.
019	PSA	119	141	Kɨ gumazir kɨnim ezɨ gumazamiziba na dɨpofi, ezɨ kɨ nɨn akabagh nɨghnɨghavɨra iti.
