020	PRO	029	007	Gumazamizir aghuiba me onganarazibagh amir gumazamizibar osɨmtɨziba bagha nɨghnɨgha, men akurvagha osɨmtɨzir kaba kɨri. Ezɨ gumazamizir arazir kurabagh amiba, arazir kamɨn mɨngarim gɨfozir puvatɨ.
