024	JER	048	006	Me kamaghɨn mɨgei: Ia zuamɨram aregh. Puvatɨghtɨ ia ikuvigham. Ia asɨzir atiabar mɨn mangɨ gumazamiziba puvatɨzir danganimɨn mongegh.
024	JER	048	007	“Moap, nɨ ingarizir biziba ko, dagɨaba bagha pamtemɨn nɨghnɨgha ghaze: Bizir kaba nɨn akuraghtɨ nɨ deraghvɨra ikiam. Ezɨ nɨn nɨghnɨzir kam derazir puvatɨ. Kamaghɨn amizɨ, nɨn apaniba mɨdorozimɨn nɨ dɨkabɨragham. Egh me nɨn aser kam Kemos inigh mangɨ kantrin igharazimɨn kalabus datɨgham. Egh me uaghan Kemosɨn ofa gamir gumaziba ko, an ingangarir gumazibar dapaniba sara iniam.
