024	JER	048	026	Ikiavɨra Itir God kamaghɨn mɨgei: “Moap na batoke, kamaghɨn amizɨ, apaniba a dɨkabɨnasa kɨ ifonge. Egh a damightɨ a mati gumazim dɨpar onganim amezɨ moghɨn otogham. A uan mimizibagh isɨn daku, egh tintinibar poghpogham, eghtɨ gumazamiziba an ingarɨva akam.
