024	JER	048	034	“Moapia bar puvɨram arangɨva, Hesbonɨn nguibamɨn ikegh mangɨ, Elealen nguibar ekiam ko notɨn amadaghan, Jahasɨn nguibamɨn tugham. Egh Soarɨn nguibamɨn ikegh mangɨ Horonaimɨn nguibam ko sautɨn amadaghan Eklat Selisian nguibamɨn tugham. Guizbangɨra, men kantrin nguibaba bar ikuvigham. Eghtɨ Nimrimɨn Fanem uaghan bar dakegham.
