033	MIC	004	006	Ikiavɨra Itir God kamaghɨn mɨgɨa ghaze, “Gɨn otivamin dughiamɨn, gumazamizir kɨ faragha ivezir kuram me ganɨga, kalabuziar gumazamizibar mɨn kantrin igharazimɨn amadaziba ko, suer kurar daruan iburaziba, kɨ ua me akuvam.
033	MIC	004	007	Ezɨ gumazamizir ikiavɨra itir varazira, me uan nguibamɨn saghon ikia, egha daruan iburaghburaki, me gumazamizir suer kurar pazava aruiba. Ezɨ datɨrɨghɨn itir varazira kɨ ua me damightɨ, me kantrin bar gavgavimɨn mɨn otogham. Eghtɨ datɨrɨghɨn ikegh mangɨ, kɨ Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ Saionɨn Mɨghsɨamɨn ikɨ, men atrivimɨn ikɨ, me gativagh mamaghɨra ikiam.”
033	MIC	004	008	Ezɨ nɨ Jerusalem, God nɨn ikia uan gumazamizibar gari, mati sipsipbar gari gumazim uan sipsipbar garir dɨpenir dɨvazimɨn aven iti. Nɨ faragha me geghuvi moghɨn, nɨ bar ekevegh uan kantrin nguibaba bar da gativagh, dagh eghuvam.
