038	ZEC	008	016	Egh ia arazir kabar amu: Ia bar moghɨrama guizɨn akabar gumazamizir igharazibav kɨm. Egh ia kotiamɨn deragh guizɨn akam akɨrightɨ, mɨgɨrɨgɨaba bar gɨvagham.
038	ZEC	008	017	Ia arazir kurabar gumazamizir igharazibar amusɨ nɨghnɨghan markɨ. Ia kotiamɨn mɨtivigh, akar ifavaribar amuan markɨ. Kɨ ifavarir arazim ko, kotiam oteghavkɨrir arazim ko, uarir atara uariv sozir araziba, kɨ bar dar aghua.”
