038	ZEC	010	011	Kɨ me inightɨ me uamategh uan nguibamɨn izam, eghtɨ Isipia ko, Asiriaba ongarir ekiamɨn mɨn men tuavim apɨrightɨ, kɨ me abɨnigham. Kamaghɨra, kɨ Isipian gavgavim agɨvagh, egh uaghan Nailɨn Fanem damightɨ a mɨsigham. Eghtɨ Asirian gavgavim uaghan gɨvagham.
