038	ZEC	012	002	“Kɨ Jerusalem damightɨ a wain itir kavɨn mɨn otogham. Eghtɨ kantrin igharazir an boroghɨn ikia, a gasɨghasɨghasava amiba, me mati gumazir wainɨn kavɨn kam amegha onganiziba. Me mɨdorozim bagh Jerusalemɨn nguibar ekiamɨn mangɨva, me Judan nguibar dozir igharaziba bar da sara ekɨarugham.
