# BOOK	041	MAR	Mark	Mak
041	MAR	001	001	Kar Godɨn Otarim Krais Iesusɨn Akar Aghuim.
041	MAR	001	002	God fomɨra uan akam isa, an akam inigha izir gumazim Aisaia ganɨngi. Ezɨ an an osirizɨma, an akɨnafarimɨn iti. Akar kamra kara: “Ia oragh! Kɨ uan abuir gumazim amadaghtɨma, a faragh mangɨ nɨ bagh tuavim akɨram.
041	MAR	001	003	Gumazir tiarir mam gumazamiziba puvatɨzir danganimɨn dɨa ghaze, ‘Ia Ekiam bagh tuaviba azenɨva, dar kɨr.’”
041	MAR	001	004	Kamaghɨn amizɨma, Gumazamiziba Ruer Gumazim Jon izava gumazamiziba puvatɨzir danganimɨn ikiava gumazamiziba rua kamaghɨn akam akuri, “Ia navibagh iraghtɨ, kɨ ia rueghtɨ, God ian arazir kuraba gɨn amadagham.”
041	MAR	001	005	An akar kabav geima Judian Distrighɨn itir nguibaba koma Jerusalemɨn nguibar ekiamɨn itir gumazamiziba, me bar iza uan arazir kurabar gun mɨgeima, a Jordanɨn Fanemɨn me rue.
041	MAR	001	006	Jon, Gumazamiziba Ruer Gumazim, an asɨzim kamelɨn arɨzibar ingarizir iniba ikegha asɨzir inim uan ivariam gike. A inir kaba ikeghava odeziba ko ruarimɨn haniba api.
041	MAR	001	007	Ezɨ an akam kamaghɨn mɨgei, “Nan gɨn izamin gumazim an gavgavim guizbangɨra nan gavgavim gafira. Kɨ an mɨn garir puvatɨ. Kɨ uaghan aviraghɨva an dagarir asuabar beniba fɨran gavgaviba puvatɨ.
041	MAR	001	008	Kɨ dɨpamɨn ia rue, eghtɨ a gɨn Godɨn Duamɨn ia ruam.”
041	MAR	001	009	Dughiar kam Iesus Galilin Distrighɨn itir nguibam, Nasaret, ategha Jon bagha izezɨma, a Jordanɨn Fanemɨn a rue.
041	MAR	001	010	Iesus dɨpamɨn aven ikegha azenan otivavɨra ikia garima overiam kuiaghirɨzɨ Godɨn Duam bunbamɨn mɨn mɨghegha a bagha izaghiri.
041	MAR	001	011	Ezɨ tiarir mam Godɨn Nguibamɨn ikiava kamaghɨn dei, “Nɨ nan Otarim. Kɨ guizbangɨra nɨ gifuegha nɨ bagha bar akonge.”
041	MAR	001	012	Ezɨ Godɨn Duam anemadazɨma a gumazamiziba puvatɨzir danganimɨn ghu.
041	MAR	001	013	A ghugha, 40plan dughiabar danganir kamɨn itima, Satan a gifarasa a gakaghori. A ruarimɨn itir asɨziba ko ikia dar torimɨn itima, Godɨn enselba an garava an akurvasi.
041	MAR	001	014	Ezɨ me Jon, Gumazamiziba Ruer Gumazim, inigha kalabus gatɨzɨma, Iesus gɨn Galilin Distrighɨn ghugha Godɨn Akar Aghuim akuri.
041	MAR	001	015	A kamaghɨn mɨgei, “Dughiam otogha gɨfa. God Bizibagh Ativamin Dughiam roghɨra ize. Ia navibagh iragh nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Godɨn Akar Aghuimɨn ikɨ.”
041	MAR	001	016	Dughiar mam Iesus Galilin Dɨpar Akaremɨn dadarimɨn ghua Saimon uan dozim Andru ko aningɨn garima, aning osiriba baghava uan iver ekiaba akuri. Aning osiriba isa dagɨaba bagha da amadir gumazimning.
041	MAR	001	017	Ezɨ Iesus kamaghɨn aning mɨgei, “Gua nan gɨn izɨtɨ kɨ guan akakaghtɨma, gua osiriba isi moghɨn gumazamiziba iniam.”
041	MAR	001	018	Ezɨ aning an akam baraghavɨra uan iveba ategha an gɨn zui.
