041	MAR	001	020	An aningɨn garavɨra aningɨn diazɨma, aning maghɨra uan afeziam Sebedi koma an ingangarir gumaziba ataghizɨ me uan botɨn itima aning Iesusɨn gɨn zui.
041	MAR	001	021	Ezɨ Iesus ko an gɨn zuir darazi Kaperneamɨn ghue. Me zuezɨ Sabat otozɨma, a God ko mɨgeir dɨpenimɨn aven ghugha, dɨpenir kamɨn aven itir gumazamizibar sure gami.
041	MAR	001	022	A men sure gamima gumazamiziba bar an akam baregha dɨgavir kuram gami. An mɨgɨrɨgɨar kaba mati gavgavim itir gumazimɨn mɨgɨrɨgɨaba. An mɨgɨrɨgɨaba Judan Arazibagh fozir gumazibar mɨgɨrɨgɨabar mɨn zuir puvatɨ. Ezɨ gumazamiziba dɨgavir kuram gami.
