041	MAR	002	010	Kɨ arazir kam damightɨma, ia ganigh fogham, Gumazamizibar Otarim a nguazir kamɨn arazir kuraba gɨn amangamin gavgavim iti.” Egha kamaghɨn gumazir soroghafariba amɨrazim mɨgei,
041	MAR	002	011	“Kɨ nɨ mɨgei, nɨ dɨkavigh uan akuriam inigh dɨpenimɨn mangɨ.”
