041	MAR	003	001	Egha dughiar igharazir mam Iesus God ko mɨgeir dɨpenimɨn ghua garima, dafarim ekonezir gumazir mam, gumazamizir avɨribar tongɨn dɨpenir kamɨn aven iti. A itima gumazir maba uaghan iti. Me, Iesus bizitam damightɨ, me akam agasasa bar deravɨram an gari. Me kamaghsua an gari. A Sabatɨn gumazir kamɨn akuragham, o?
041	MAR	003	003	Me bizir kam bagha an garavɨra itima, Iesus kamaghɨn dafarim ekonezir gumazim mɨgei, “Nɨ dɨkavigh izɨ bar en guamɨn tugh.”
041	MAR	003	004	Gumazim dɨkavigha tuzɨma, Iesus kamaghɨn men azara, “Arazir manam Sabatɨn arazim abɨki? E arazir aghuim damuam, o arazir kuram damuam, o gumazimɨn akuragham, o gumazim gasɨghasɨgham?” A kamaghɨn men azarazɨma, me bar nɨmɨra iti.
041	MAR	003	005	An damazimning bar gumazamizibagh aruava, navimɨn aven men atari. A men garima, men naviba gavgavigha apangkuvir nɨghnɨziba men puvatɨ. Kamaghɨn a bar osemegha gumazim kamaghɨn a mɨgei, “Nɨ uan dafarim onegh.” Ezɨ gumazir kam uan dafarim onezɨma, an dafarim ua dera.
041	MAR	003	006	Ezɨ Farisiba kamaghɨn ganigha dɨpenim ategha azenan ghuegha Herotɨn gumaziba ko ikia Iesus mɨsoghasa akabar kɨri.
041	MAR	003	007	Ezɨ Iesus uan suren gumaziba ko Galilin Dɨpar Akaremɨn ghuaghiri. A ghuaghirima gumazamizir avɨriba Galilin Distrighɨn ikegha an gɨn ghuaghiri.
041	MAR	003	008	Gumazamizir avɨriba Judian Distrik ko, Jerusalemɨn nguibam ko, Idumean Distrik ko, Jordanɨn Fanemɨn vongɨn itir danganiba ko, Tair ko Saidonɨn nguibamningɨn ikegha Iesus bagha ghuaghiri. Gumazamizir avɨrir kaba, me an amizir bizibar akam baregha a bagha ghuaghiri.
041	MAR	003	009	Me iraghuezɨma, Iesus gumazamizir avɨribar akurazɨma, men arɨmariaba gɨfa. Arɨmariaba itir gumazamizir avɨriba uan arɨmariaba agɨvasa Iesusɨn boroghɨn uari akuvagha, Iesusɨn suighasa uari munamadi. Kamaghɨn amizɨ, Iesus uan suren gumazibav gɨa ghaze, “Ia botɨn tam inigh izɨ puram anetɨghtɨ a ikɨ. Eghtɨ gumazamiziba bar na akuvaghtɨma kɨ botɨn ghuavanangam.”
041	MAR	003	011	Iesus me mɨgeima, duar kuraba apazazir gumazir maba iza, Iesusɨn gara duar kuraba zuamɨra me gamima me Iesusɨn guamɨn daighira kamaghɨn dɨa mɨgei, “Nɨ Godɨn Otarim.”
041	MAR	003	012	Me kamaghɨn mɨgeima, a men anogorogha ghaze, me an gun gumazir igharazibav kɨman markɨ.
041	MAR	003	013	Egha Iesus dɨpar mɨriamɨn ikegha dɨkavigha mɨghsɨamɨn ghuavanabogha uan ifongezir gumazibar diazɨma, me a bagha zui.
041	MAR	003	014	Me zuima a gumazir 12pla mɨsevegha ziar kam, aposelba, me gatɨ. Eghtɨ me a ko ikɨtɨ, a gɨn me amangɨtɨ me mangɨ Godɨn Akar Aghuim akunam.
041	MAR	003	015	Egh a uan gavgavim me danɨngtɨma me uaghan duar kuraba batogham.
041	MAR	003	016	A mɨsevezir gumazir 12plan ziabar kara. Saimon (Iesus gɨn ziar kam, Pita, a gatɨ),
041	MAR	003	017	Sebedin otarimning Jems ko Jon (A ziar kam aning gatɨ, Boanerges. Ziar kamɨn mɨngarim kamaghɨn ghu, atara pamtem mɨgeir gumazimning),
041	MAR	003	018	Andru ko Filip, Bartolomyu, Matyu, Tomas, Alfiusɨn otarim Jems, Tadius, Saimon (a Selotbar gumazir mam),
041	MAR	003	019	ko Judas Iskariot, gumazir Iesus isava, apanibagh anɨngizim.
041	MAR	003	020	Egha Iesus uamategha dɨpenimɨn aven ghugha itima gumazamizir avɨriba izava anekufa. Me bar anekufa, kamaghɨn amizɨ, a uan suren gumaziba ko daghebar aman ibura. Me damamin dughiaba puvatɨ.
041	MAR	003	021	Ezɨ gumazamizir maba kamaghɨn mɨgei, “An ongani.” Ezɨ Iesusɨn adarazi akar kam baregha, a inigh mangasa izi.
041	MAR	003	022	Ezɨ Judan Arazibagh fozir gumazir maba Jerusalemɨn ikegha izaghira kamaghɨn mɨgei, “Belsebul a gapasa. A duar kurabar gumazir dapanimɨn gavgavimɨn duar kuraba batosi.”
041	MAR	003	023	Ezɨ Iesus me mɨgeir akam baregha, egha kamaghɨn gumazamizibar diagha akar isɨn zuir mabar me mɨgei, “Satan manmaghɨn uabɨra uabɨ batuegham?
041	MAR	003	024	Kantrin tamɨn gumazamiziba uari tuiragh uarira uariv soghtɨ, kantrin kam ikian kogham.
041	MAR	003	025	Eghtɨ dɨpenir vamɨran itir darazi uari abigh uarira uariv sogh dɨpenir kamɨn itir darazi ikian kogham.
041	MAR	003	026	Kamaghɨra Satan uan adarazi ko uari abigh uariv sogh, egh me manmaghɨn tugh gavgavigh bizibar ganamin gavgavim ikiam? Bar puvatɨgham.
041	MAR	003	027	“Eghtɨ gumazir manatam puram aven mangɨ gumazir gavgavitamɨn dɨpenim akarighɨva an biziba okemegham? Puvatɨgham. A faraghɨvɨra benibar gumazir gavgavir kam ikegham. A kamaghɨn a damigh, egh gumazir kamɨn dɨpenimɨn aven mangɨ, an biziba okemegham.
041	MAR	003	028	“Kɨ guizbangɨra ia mɨgei, gumazamizibar arazir kuraba ko me Godɨn ziam gasɨghasɨzir akaba, God da gɨn amangamin tuavim iti.
041	MAR	003	029	Eghtɨ gumazitam Godɨn Duamɨn ziam gasɨghasightɨma God an arazir kurar kam, a gɨn amadaghan kogham. Egh gumazir kam aremeghtɨ, arazir kurar kam an ikɨvɨra ikiam.”
041	MAR	003	030	Me faragha kamaghɨn a mɨgɨa ghaze, “Duar kurar mam a gapasa.” A bizir kam bagha, akar kabar me mɨgei.
041	MAR	003	031	Ezɨ Iesusɨn amebam ko doziba izava, a itir dɨpenimɨn tiar akamɨn tughava gumazir mam amadazɨma a Iesus mɨkɨmasa aven zui.
041	MAR	003	032	Ezɨ gumazamizir avɨriba a koma apiaghav ikia kamaghɨn a mɨgei, “Nɨ oragh, nɨn amebam ko doziba nɨ bagha izeghava azenan iti.”
041	MAR	003	033	Me a mɨkemezɨma a kamaghɨn men azara, “Tina nan amebam? Te nan doziba?”
041	MAR	003	034	A kamaghɨn men azaragha, egha an okarigha apiaghav itir gumazamizibar gara, kamaghɨn me mɨgei, “Ia gan! Nan amebam ko dozibara kara.
041	MAR	003	035	Gumazamizir God ifongezir arazibar gɨn zuiba, me nan doziba ko nan amiziba ko nan amebam.”
041	MAR	004	001	Dughiar igharazir mam Iesus ua dɨpar mɨriamɨn ikiava, gumazamizir mabar sure gami. Me an akaba baraghasa anekuvagha guizbangɨra bar avɨraseme. Ezɨ a botɨn mamɨn bɨragha dɨpam gisɨn aperaghav iti. Gumazamizir kaba an boroghɨn dadarimɨn apiaghav iti.
041	MAR	004	002	An akar isɨn zuir avɨribar men sure gamuava, kamaghɨn me mɨgei,
041	MAR	004	003	“Ia oragh. Gumazir mam raizɨn mɨn garir daghem wit, ana da inigha ghua azenimɨn da akuragharui.
041	MAR	004	004	An ada akurima witɨn ovɨzir maba tuavimɨn irezɨma, kuaraziba iza da ame.
041	MAR	004	005	Ezɨ maba dagɨabagh isɨn itir nguazir evarim gire. Nguazir kam mɨtemezir puvatɨ, ezɨ witɨn ovɨziba zuamɨra afuangi.
041	MAR	004	006	Ezɨ dar biba bar nguazimɨn aven iraghuezir puvatɨzɨ, aruem anaga dagh isirazɨ, da isia mɨsɨngi.
041	MAR	004	007	Ezɨ witɨn ovɨzir maba benir dɨkoniba itir nguazim giregha, benibar tongɨn afuangizɨ, benir dɨkoniba aghuava da ikiagharɨki. Ezɨ dar ovɨziba mɨsevezir puvatɨ.
041	MAR	004	008	Ezɨ witɨn ovɨzir maba nguazir aghuim giregha aghuava dagheba mɨsefi. Egha maba 30plan ovɨziba mɨsevima maba 60plan ovɨziba mɨsefe. Ezɨ maba 100plan ovɨziba mɨsefe.”
041	MAR	004	009	Iesus mɨgɨa ghua kamaghɨn me mɨgei, “Tina kuarimning iti, an oragh.”
041	MAR	004	010	Ezɨ gumazamizir avɨriba bar ghuezɨ, Iesus uabɨra itima, an 12plan gumaziba ko an boroghɨn itir gumazamiziba, me an akar isɨn zuimɨn mɨngarim bagha an azara.
041	MAR	004	011	Me an azarazɨma a kamaghɨn me mɨgei, “God fofozim ia ganɨngizɨma, ia God Bizibagh Ativamin Dughiamɨn akar mogomebagh fo. Egha kɨ azenan itir gumazamiziba pura akar isɨn zuibar me mɨgei.
041	MAR	004	012	Kamaghɨn amizɨma: “‘Me zurara ganɨva, egh deragh bizitamɨn ganighan kogham. Me uaghan zurara oraghɨva, egh me deragh bizitamɨn mɨngarim gɨfoghan kogham. Me amuava akar mɨngarim gɨfogha, uan navibagh irazɨ, God men arazir kuraba gɨn amadaghai.’”
041	MAR	004	013	An akar kam ua kamaghɨn me mɨgei, “Ia witɨn akar isɨn zuir kamɨn mɨngarim gɨfoz, o puvatɨ? Ia manmaghɨn akar isɨn zuir igharazir tabagh fogham?
041	MAR	004	014	Akar isɨn zuimɨn aven itir gumazir kam, a mati gumazir Godɨn akam akuragharuim.
041	MAR	004	015	Gumazamizir maba tuavim girezir witɨn ovɨzibar mɨn ami. Me Godɨn akaba baraghizɨ, Satan zuamɨra iza me oraghizir Godɨn akaba, me dama ada ini.
041	MAR	004	016	Gumazamizir maba dagɨaba itir nguazim girezir witɨn ovɨzibar mɨn ami. Me Godɨn akaba baregha da bagha bar akonge.
041	MAR	004	017	Egha men biba iraghuezir puvatɨgha, uaghan dughiar ruarimɨn ikezir puvatɨ. Me itima osɨmtɨziba ko Godɨn gɨn zuir gumazamizibagh asɨghasɨzir araziba izima, me pura God ataki.
041	MAR	004	018	Gumazamizir maba benir dɨkoniba itir nguazim girezir witɨn ovɨzibar mɨn ami. Me Godɨn akaba baraki.
041	MAR	004	019	Me da baregha uaghan nguazir kamɨn biziba bagha nɨghnɨgha, dagɨar avɨriba iniasa ifavarir nɨghnɨzibagh amua, nguazir kamɨn bizir avɨribar garava da bagha agoi. Bizir kabar nɨghnɨziba izava Godɨn akaba ikiagharɨghizɨ da mɨsevir puvatɨ.
041	MAR	004	020	Ezɨ gumazamizir maba nguazir aghuim girezir witɨn ovɨzibar mɨn ami. Me Godɨn akaba baregha dar suiragha dar gɨn zui. Gumazamizir kaba mati witɨn ovɨziba mɨsɨva, maba 30plan ovɨziba mɨsevima, maba 60plan ovɨziba mɨsevima maba 100plan ovɨziba mɨsefe.”
041	MAR	004	021	Egha Iesus kamaghɨn me mɨgei, “Ian tina lam gaborogha a inigha itarir ekiamɨn anevara? O an a inigha dakozimɨn apengan anetɨ? Puvatɨ! Ia lam daborogh a inigh azenan an danganimram aneguragh.
041	MAR	004	022	Kamaghɨra mogomer biziba da gɨn azenan otivigham. Eghtɨ bizir amigha aveziba da uaghan gɨn azenan otivigham.
041	MAR	004	023	Tina kuarimning iti, an oragh.”
041	MAR	004	024	Egha a ua kamaghɨn mɨgei, “Ia deraghvɨra akar kam baragh. Gumazitam o amizitam Godɨn akabagh foghtɨ, God uan akabar fofozir igharaziba a danɨngam, eghtɨ a Godɨn akar avɨribagh fogham. Eghtɨ Godɨn akabagh foghan aghuazir gumazim o amizim, an fofozir muziarim God a dam a inigham.”
041	MAR	004	026	Egha Iesus mɨgɨa ghua kamaghɨn me mɨgei, “God Bizibagh Ativamin Dughiamɨn arazim a kamakɨn. Gumazir mam dagher ovɨziba inigha nguazimɨn da akuri.
041	MAR	004	027	Gumazir kam da kunigha, dɨmagaribar akuava, aruebar dɨkavigha arui. An aruima dagher ovɨzir kaba da afuegha aghui. Dagher ovɨzir kaba manmaghɨn afuegha aghui? Gumazir kam fozir puvatɨ.
041	MAR	004	028	Ezɨ nguazimra dagher ovɨzir kabagh amizɨma da aghua mɨsefe. Da faragha afuegha aghua ghua aghariba otivigha, ada ghua akɨmariba otivigha mɨsefe.
041	MAR	004	029	Da mɨsevegha dagheba itima, gumazir kam sabam inigha dar akori. A fo, dagheba iti, ezɨ da akoramin dughiam oto.”
041	MAR	004	030	Egha a ua kamaghɨn mɨgei, “E manmaghɨn God Bizibagh Ativamin Dughiamɨn arazim mɨkɨmam? O, e akar isɨn zuir manamɨn an mɨngarimɨn gun mɨkɨmam?
041	MAR	004	031	A mastetɨn ovɨzimɨn mɨn gari. Mastetɨn zuravarir ovɨziba bar sufi. Temer igharazibar ovɨziba bar a gafiragha ekefe.
041	MAR	004	032	Gumazir mam anekunizɨma a gɨn aghua bar ekevegha azenimɨn itir zuravariba bar dagh afiragha bar ekefe. An ekevegha an aguar ekiaba uari tuirazɨma kuaraziba izava an aguabar dughuazimɨn aven ikia mɨkonibar ingari.”
041	MAR	004	033	Egha Iesus men nɨghnɨziba tuzɨnaghɨra, an akar isɨn zuir avɨribar Godɨn akabar me mɨgei.
