041	MAR	005	034	Ezɨ Iesus kamaghɨn a mɨgei, “Nan guivim, nɨ navim bar amɨragh ikɨ. Nɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nan iti. Kamaghɨn, nɨn nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nɨ gamizɨ nɨ dera. Nɨ navir amɨrizim sara mangɨ, eghtɨ nɨn arɨmariar kam ua nɨ damuan kogham.”
