041	MAR	006	008	A mɨgɨrɨgɨar kam me gamuava me amada, “Ia mangɨ, bizitaba uari bagh da inian markɨ. Ia bretɨn tam ko mɨtaritam inian markɨ. Ia dagɨatam suighan markɨ. Ia uan dagarir asuaba aghuva, ua siotɨn tam inian markɨ. Ia uan aghorir asadivibara suigh mangɨ.
