041	MAR	006	014	Iesus bizir avɨribagh amizɨ an ziam otogha ekevezɨ, gumazir avɨriba a gɨfo. Ezɨ danganir kamɨn Atrivim Herot, a baraki. Men marazi kamaghɨn mɨgei, “Jon Gumazamiziba Ruer Gumazim aremegha ua dɨkafi. Kamaghɨn a mirakelbar amuamin gavgavim iti.”
