041	MAR	006	023	A kamaghɨn a mɨkemegha, akar dɨkɨrɨzir gavgavim kamaghɨn a mɨgei, “Kɨ guizbangɨra nɨ mɨgei, nɨ bizitam gifongegh, na mɨkɨm. Nɨ kɨ garir bizibagh ifongeghɨva, na mɨkɨm. Kɨ tongɨra da bighɨva, taba nɨ danigham.”
