041	MAR	012	043	Ezɨ Iesus uan suren gumazibar diagha kamaghɨn me mɨgei, “Kɨ guizbangɨra ia mɨgei, biziba puvatɨzir amuir odiarir kam dagɨar muziarir pumuning dagɨaba arɨzir danganim gatɨ, ezɨ an dagɨar pumuning gumazir igharaziba arɨghizir dagɨabagh afira.
