041	MAR	014	044	Gumazir Iesus isɨ men dafaribar arɨghasava amim faragha ghaze, “Kɨ arazir kam ian akagham. Gumazir kɨ toramim, kar Iesusra. Ia an suiragh, deraghvɨra an ganɨva, egh a inigh mangɨ.”
041	MAR	014	045	Ezɨ Judas Iesus bagha ghuavɨra ikia kamaghɨn mɨgei, “Tisa!” Egha an tore.
041	MAR	014	046	Ezɨ gumaziba izava Iesusɨn agharibagh iregha, pamtem an suiki.
041	MAR	014	047	Ezɨ Iesusɨn boroghɨn itir gumazir mam uan mɨdorozir sabam asigha, ofa gamir gumazibar dapanimɨn ingangarir gumazimɨn kuarim atuzɨ, an kuarim dutuaghirɨ.
041	MAR	014	048	Ezɨ Iesus kamaghɨn me mɨgei, “Kɨ okɨmakɨar gumazim puvatɨ. Ia tizim bagha nan suighasa mɨdorozir sababa koma asianiba suigha izi?
041	MAR	014	049	Kɨ zurara ia ko ikia, Godɨn Dɨpenim avɨnizir dɨvazimɨn aven gumazamizibar sure gami. Ezɨ ia nan suighan aghua. Ezɨ Godɨn Akɨnafarimɨn osizirim mɨkemezir moghɨra ia kamaghɨn na gami.”
041	MAR	014	050	Ezɨma Iesusɨn suren gumaziba bar aneteghava are.
041	MAR	014	051	Ezɨ gumazir igiar mam bizitam aruzir puvatɨgha, inir ghurghurir azenan itimra ikegha Iesusɨn gɨn zui. Ezɨ Iesusɨn apaniba an suirazɨma,
041	MAR	014	052	a uan azenan itir inir ghurghurim ategha bibiamrama arav ghu.
041	MAR	014	053	Ezɨ Iesusɨn apaniba a inigha ofa gamir gumazibar dapanim bagha ghu. Ezɨ ofa gamir gumazir ekiaba ko Judabar gumazir aruaba, ko Judan Arazibagh fozir gumaziba, me bar iza uari akufa.
041	MAR	014	054	Ezɨ Pita mong tɨzim a gatɨgha Iesusɨn gɨn ghua bar ghua ofa gamir gumazibar dapanimɨn dɨpenimɨn dɨvazimɨn aven ghu. Egha kagh ganganir gumaziba ko apiaghav ikia avimɨn fɨi.
041	MAR	014	055	Ezɨ ofa gamir gumazir ekiaba ko, Judan kotɨn aven itir gumaziba bar, me Iesusɨn mɨsueghtɨ an aremeghasa akar men akurvaziba buria, tam batozir puvatɨ.
041	MAR	014	056	Gumazir avɨriba ifavarir mɨgɨrɨgɨabar Iesus gami, ezɨ men mɨgɨrɨgɨaba voroghɨra zuir puvatɨ.
041	MAR	014	057	Ezɨ marazi dɨkavigha ifavarir akar kamɨn a mɨgei,
041	MAR	014	058	“E orazi, a ghaze, ‘Kɨ Godɨn Dɨpenir gumaziba ingarizim apɨrigh, egh dughiar pumuning ko mɨkezimɨn, igharazitamɨn ingarigham. Godɨn Dɨpenir kɨ ingaramim, gumaziba uan dafaribar ingarizir puvatɨzimɨn ingarigham.’”
041	MAR	014	059	Ezɨ mɨgɨrɨgɨar kaba uaghan guizbangɨra voroghɨra zuir puvatɨ.
041	MAR	014	060	Ezɨma ofa gamir gumazibar dapanim dɨkavigha men tongɨn tugha egha Iesusɨn azara, “Nɨ akatam ikarvaghan aghua? Me nɨ gasir akar kam, a guizbangɨra, o?”
041	MAR	014	061	Ezɨ Iesus nɨmɨra ikia men mɨgɨrɨgɨatam ikarazir puvatɨ. Ezɨ ofa gamir gumazibar dapanim uam an azara, “Nɨ Krais, God Uam E Iniasa Mɨsevezir Gumazim? Nɨ gumazamiziba ziam fer Godɨn Otarim?”
041	MAR	014	062	Ezɨ Iesus kamaghɨn a mɨgei, “Kɨ an Otarimra. Ia gantɨ, Gumazamizibar Otarim gavgavim itir Godɨn agharir guvim daperagh overiamɨn ghuariaba sara izam.”
041	MAR	014	063	Ezɨ ofa gamir gumazibar dapanim uan korotiaba abigha azara, “E tizim bagh ua akar akurvaziba buriam? Markiam!
041	MAR	014	064	Ia uari a barasi, a mɨgɨrɨgɨar kurabar Godɨn ziam gasɨghasɨsi. Ezɨ ia manmaghɨn nɨghnɨsi?” Ezɨ me bar akam a gasa ghaze, an aremegham.
041	MAR	014	065	Egha marazi a gipari. Egha me an damaziba avaragha, uan agharibar a mɨsogha kamaghɨn mɨgei, “Nɨ mɨkɨm. Tinara nɨ mɨsosi?” Ezɨ ganganir gumaziba a inigha a mɨsoghavɨra iti.
041	MAR	014	066	Dughiar kamra Pita dɨpenimɨn dɨvazimɨn aven vangɨnan itima, ofa gamir gumazibar dapanimɨn ingangarir guivir mam izi.
041	MAR	014	067	Egha Pitan garima an avimɨn fɨima, a dɨkɨravɨram an gara, kamaghɨn mɨgei, “Nɨ uaghan Nasaretɨn gumazir kam, Iesus ko ike.”
041	MAR	014	068	Ezɨ Pita uabɨn ghuaragha ghaze, “Kɨ nɨ mɨgeir bizir mam gɨfozir puvatɨ.” Egha dɨvazimɨn tiar akar ekiamɨn otivasa azenan ghu. Ezɨ tuarim ati.
041	MAR	014	069	Ezɨ ingangarir guivir kam kagh an apigha tuivighav itir gumazamiziba ua me mɨgei, “Muna men mav.”
041	MAR	014	070	Ezɨ a ua uabɨn tira. Ezɨ mong gɨn, an boroghɨn tuivighav itir darazi Pita mɨgei, “Nɨ Galilin gumazim, kamaghɨn guizbangɨra nɨ men mavɨra.”
041	MAR	014	071	Ezɨ a pamtem mɨgɨa ghaze, Kɨ guizbangɨra mɨgei, kɨ ifaraghtɨma God na gasɨghasigham. Egha kamaghɨn me mɨgei, “Kɨ gumazir ia mɨgeir kam gɨfozir puvatɨ.”
041	MAR	014	072	A kamaghɨn mɨgɨavɨra itima tuarim uam ake. Ezɨ Pita Iesus a mɨkemezir mɨgɨrɨgɨam ginɨrɨ, “Nɨ faragh dughiar pumuning ko mɨkezimɨn suam, kɨ Iesus gɨfozir puvatɨ, eghtɨ tuarim gɨn dughiar pumuningɨn akegham.” Egha Pita nɨghnɨghava avegha bar puvɨrama azi.
041	MAR	015	001	Egha bar mɨzaraghara, ofa gamir gumazir ekiaba, ko Judabar gumazir aruaba, ko Judan Arazibagh fozir gumaziba, ko Judan kotɨn aven itir gumazir igharaziba sara, me nɨghnɨzir mam bato. Egha me Iesusɨn dafariba ikegha an akua ghua Pailat ganɨngi.
