# BOOK	046	1CO	1 Corinthians	1 Korin
046	1CO	001	001	Kɨ Pol, kɨ Krais Iesusɨn aposel. God uabɨ ifongegha, na gamizɨ kɨ aposelɨn oto. Kɨ, Kraisɨn gɨn zuir gumazim Sostenes ko,
046	1CO	001	002	ga akɨnafarir kam ia Korinɨn nguibar ekiamɨn itir sios bagha an osiri. Krais Iesus ia gamizɨma, ia a baghavɨra iti. Egha a ua bagha ia amɨsevezɨ, ia a ko poroghav iti. A ia ko, nguazimɨn itir gumazamizir Krais Iesusɨn ziam feba bar, a ia mɨsefe. Krais Iesus, en Ekiam. A men Ekiam, ko uaghan en Ekiam.
046	1CO	001	003	Kɨ God ko mɨgɨa ghaze, God en Afeziam ko en Ekiam Krais Iesus, aning ian apangkuv, egh navir amɨrizim ia danɨng.
046	1CO	001	004	God, Krais Iesusɨn ingangarimɨn tuavimɨn, ian apangkuvigha, deragha ia gami. Kamaghɨn kɨ zurara ia gɨnɨghnɨgha uan God mɨnabi.
046	1CO	001	005	Kɨ a mɨnabagha ghaze, Kraisɨn akar e ia mɨkɨnizim, a ian navibar ikia gavgafi. Ia Krais ko poroghav itima, God bizir aghuir avɨrim ia ganɨngizɨ, da ia gizɨfa, kar akam akurir arazir avɨriba, ko fofozir guar avɨriba.
046	1CO	001	007	Kamaghɨn, ia datɨrɨghɨn en Ekiam Krais Iesus azenim giramin dughiam mɨzua, Godɨn Duam anɨngizir bizir aghuitam, ia an otevizir puvatɨ.
046	1CO	001	008	Krais Iesus gavgavim ia danɨngtɨ, ia gavgavigh mangɨ, dughiar abuananamɨn otoghtɨ, bizir kuratam en Ekiam Krais Iesus Uamateghamin Dughiamɨn ian ikian kogham.
046	1CO	001	009	God uan Otarim Krais Iesus, en Ekiam a ko navir vamɨra ikiasa ian dia. Eghtɨ God damuasa mɨkemezɨ biziba, a bar adar amigham.
046	1CO	001	010	Nan adarasi, kɨ en Ekiam Krais Iesusɨn ziamɨn pamtem kamaghɨn ia gakaghori, ia bar navir vamɨra uariv geir mɨgɨrɨgɨaba ikɨ. Egh ia tintinimɨn bɨghiran markɨ. Ia ikɨzir vamɨra, ko nɨghnɨzir vamɨra, ko ifongiar vamɨra ikɨ.
046	1CO	001	011	Nan adarasi, Kloen adarazi na mɨgɨa ghaze, ia adaribar uarigh ami.
046	1CO	001	012	Kɨ arazir ia uari adozir ian tongɨn itim mɨgei. Marazi kamaghɨn mɨgei, “Kɨ Polɨn anav.” Ezɨ marazi kamaghɨn mɨgei, “Kɨ Apolosɨn anav.” Ezɨ marazi kamaghɨn mɨgei, “Kɨ Pitan anav.” Ezɨ marazi kamaghɨn mɨgei, “Kɨ Kraisɨn anav.”
046	1CO	001	013	Ezɨ manmakɨn? Krais ti bɨaghireghama? Kɨ Pol ti ian akurvaghasa ter ighuvimɨn aremez, o? Ia ti nan ziamɨn rurim iniz, o? Bar puvatɨ!
046	1CO	001	014	Ian tongɨn, kɨ Krispus ko Gaiusra rue, ua gumazamiziba puvatɨ. Kamaghɨn kɨ God mɨnabi.
046	1CO	001	015	Kamaghɨn amizɨ, gumazitam o amizitam kamaghɨn mɨkɨman kogham, “E Polɨn ziamɨn rurim ini.”
046	1CO	001	016	(Guizbangɨra, kɨ igharaz darazi uaghan me rue, kar Stefanasɨn dɨpenimɨn itir adarasi. Egha kɨ fozir puvatɨ, kɨ ti igharaz darazi uaghan me rues o puvatɨ.)
046	1CO	001	017	Krais gumazamiziba ruasa na amadazir pu. Puvatɨ. An akam akunasa na amada. Eghtɨ kɨ apezeperir mɨgɨrɨgɨaba ko nguazir kamɨn itir gumazamizibar fofozimɨn anekunan kogham. Kɨ kamaghɨn damu, Kraisɨn ter ighuvimɨn ovevem damightɨ, a mati pura bizim.
046	1CO	001	018	Guizbangɨra, gumazamizir ovengamiba ghaze, ter ighuvimɨn mɨgɨrɨgɨam, mati mɨgɨrɨgɨar onganim egha mɨngariba puvatɨ. Ezɨ e gumazamizir God en akurvaziba, e fo, ter ighuvimɨn mɨgɨrɨgɨam, a Godɨn gavgavim.
046	1CO	001	019	Godɨn Akɨnafarim kamaghɨn mɨgei: “Kɨ gumazir nɨghnɨzir aghuiba me ganɨdibar fofoziba adegham, egh kɨ men fofozir gumazibar fofoziba bar da agɨvagham.”
046	1CO	001	020	Eghtɨ e manmaghɨn nguazir kamɨn itir gumazamizibar nɨghnɨzir aghuibav kɨmam? E manmaghɨn Judan Arazibagh fozir gumazibav kɨmam? E gumazamizir akaba uariv sozir arazim bar a gɨfoziba, e manmaghɨn me mɨkɨmam? Guizbangɨra, God nguazir kamɨn itir fofozibagh amizɨma, da mati mɨgɨrɨgɨar onganiba mɨngariba puvatɨ.
046	1CO	001	021	Godɨn nɨghnɨzir aghuim ko an fofozimɨn, God kamaghɨn fo, nguazir kamɨn itir gumazamiziba uan fofozimɨn tuavimɨn me Godɨn fofozim inighan kogham. Kamaghɨn, God tuavir igharazir mam men akuraghasa anemɨsefe. Kar, me “mɨgɨrɨgɨar onganim,” arazir akam, e anekuri. Gumazamiziba akar kam baragha nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Godɨn itima, God men akurvasi.
046	1CO	001	022	Judaba mirakelbar ganasa bar gavgafi, ezɨ Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamiziba nɨghnɨzir aghuim ko fofozim bagha pamten ingari.
046	1CO	001	023	Ezɨ e Krais ter ighuvimɨn aremezir akam me mɨkɨri. Ezɨ akar kam Judabar nɨghnɨzimɨn, mati bizir me asaghporaghirim. Ezɨ Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamizibar nɨghnɨzim ghaze, kar mɨgɨrɨgɨar onganim.
046	1CO	001	024	Ezɨ e gumazamizir God diaziba, Juda ko Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamiziba uaghara, e fo, Kraisra a Godɨn gavgavim ko Godɨn fofozim.
046	1CO	001	025	Nguazimɨn itir gumazamiziba kamaghɨn nɨghnɨgha ghaze, “Godɨn nɨghnɨzir maba bar ongani.” Ezɨ nɨghnɨzir kamra bar gumazamizibar nɨghnɨzibagh afira. Ezɨ me kamaghɨn nɨghnɨsi, Godɨn arazir maba kamaghɨn en akakasi, God gavgaviba puvatɨ. Ezɨ an arazir kabara bar gavgavigha, bar gumazamizibar gavgavim gafira.
046	1CO	001	026	Nan adarasi, ia dughiar God ian diazim gɨnɨghnɨgh. Ian avɨriba faragha, nguazir kamɨn itir gumazamizibar damazimɨn, fofozir gumazamizibar mɨn ikezir puvatɨ. Ezɨ ian avɨriba, gavgaviba puvatɨ. Ian avɨriba, anabar ziar ekiaba itibar otivizir puvatɨ.
046	1CO	001	027	God kamaghsua, a nguazir kamɨn itir fofozir gumazamizibar amutɨ, me bar aghumsɨgham. Kamaghɨn, a gari, gumazamizir gavgaviba puvatɨgha nguazimɨn itir gumazamizibar damazimɨn nɨghnɨziba onganiziba, merara God me amɨsefe. God ghaze, a gavgaviba itir gumazamizibar amutɨ, me aghumsɨgham. Kamaghɨn, gumazamizir gavgaviba puvatɨgha nguazir kamɨn itir gumazamizibar damazimɨn itiba, merara God me amɨsefe.
046	1CO	001	028	Egha a nguazir kamɨn ziaba puvatɨzir gumazamiziba ini, kar gumazamizir me kamaghɨn mɨgeiba, me bizir kɨnir me aghuaziba. Ezɨ arazir kamɨn, God ziar ekiaba itiba ko gavgaviba itibagh amizɨ, da mati bizir kɨnibar mɨn iti.
046	1CO	001	029	Kamaghɨn amizɨ, gumazitam o amizitam Godɨn damazimɨn uabɨ uan ziam fan kogham.
046	1CO	001	030	God uabɨ ia gamizɨ, ia Krais Iesus ko poroghav iti. Ezɨ a Krais gamizɨ, a en nɨghnɨzir aghuimɨn mɨngarimɨn iti. Ezɨ Kraisɨn ingangarimɨn, God e gamizɨma, e Godɨn damazimɨn deragha, God baghavɨra iti. Ezɨ Kraisɨn ingangarimɨn, a uam e givezegha, arazir kuramɨn gavgavimɨn e fɨri.
046	1CO	001	031	Ezɨ Akɨnafarim mɨkemezɨ moghɨn God kamaghɨn ifonge, “Tina bar akongeghsɨ, an Ekiam amizir arazibagh nɨghnɨgh, a bagh bar akongegh.”
046	1CO	002	001	Nan adarasi, kɨ ia bagha izezir dughiamɨn, kɨ Godɨn akar mogomemɨn ia mɨgɨa, fofozir gumazamizibar mɨn akar ekiar guar avɨritabar ia mɨkemezir puvatɨ.
046	1CO	002	002	Kɨ faraghavɨra kamaghɨn nɨghnɨki, kɨ ian tongɨn ikiamin dughiamɨn, kɨ bizir igharazitam gɨnɨghnɨghan kogham. Puvatɨgham. Kɨ Krais Iesusra nɨghnɨghɨva, a ter ighuvimɨn aremezir ovevem uaghan a gɨnɨghnɨgham.
046	1CO	002	003	Kɨ ia ko itir dughiamɨn, kɨ guizbangɨra gavgaviba puvatɨ. Kɨ atiatiava, mɨghɨghavɨra agoi.
046	1CO	002	004	Ezɨ akar kɨ mɨkemezim ko Akar Aghuir kɨ kunizim, kɨ nguazir kamɨn itir fofozim o nɨghnɨzibagh etuir akam, ia mɨkemezir pu. Puvatɨ. God uan Duamɨn gavgavim, ian akazɨ, ia fo, kɨ mɨgeir akaba da guizbangɨra.
