047	2CO	008	017	E ua ia bagh mangasava an azangsɨsi, a mangasa bar ifonge. Egha a uaghan ingangarir kam damuasa bar ifonge. Kamaghɨn amizɨ, a uabɨ ifueghava, ia bagha ghu.
