049	EPH	005	022	Ia amizir paba itiba, ia Ekiamɨn apengan ikia a baghavɨra iti moghɨn, ia uan pabar apengan ikɨ me baghɨvɨra ikɨ.
049	EPH	005	023	E fo, Krais uan siosɨn dapanimɨn iti moghɨn, paba uan amuibar dapanibar iti. Ezɨ Krais uabɨ siosɨn Akurvazir Gumazim, ezɨ sios Kraisɨn inivafɨzimɨn mɨn iti.
049	EPH	005	024	Sios Kraisɨn apengan ikia a baghavɨra iti moghɨn, ia amuiba uaghan uan pabar apengan ikɨ me baghɨvɨra ikɨ.
049	EPH	005	025	Paba, ia uan amuiba bar me gifongegh, mati Krais uan sios gifongegha a bagha uabɨ isava a ganigha a bagha areme.
049	EPH	005	026	Krais kamaghɨn ifonge, an akamɨn tuavimɨn, a uan sios dɨpamɨn a rueghtɨ a Godɨn damazimɨn zuegham.
049	EPH	005	027	A kamaghsua, a sios damightɨ an an damazimɨn bar aghungigh, egh bar zueghɨva, arazir kuratam puvatɨgh, duar kuriba ko seghsariba puvatɨghɨva, bizir kurar maba sara uaghan puvatɨgham. Kamaghɨn Krais a bagha uabɨ isa a ganɨngi.
049	EPH	005	028	Ezɨ kamaghɨra ia gumaziba uan inivafɨzibagh ifongezɨ moghɨn, ia uan amuibagh ifongegh. Gumazir uan amuim gifongezim mati a uabɨ gifonge.
049	EPH	005	029	E fo, tav uabɨ uan inivafɨzimɨn apanim gamir pu. Puvatɨ, a dagheba a ganɨgava an akurvasi, mati Krais siosɨn akurvasi.
049	EPH	005	030	E fo, erara, e Kraisɨn inivafɨzimɨn aven itir soroghafariba ko bizibar mɨn iti.
049	EPH	005	031	Godɨn Akɨnafarimɨn aven itir osizirim kamaghɨn mɨgei: “Kamaghɨn amizɨ, gumazim uan ameboghfeziaba ategh mangɨ, uan amuim ko aning uaningɨn porogham. Egh aning inivafɨzir vamɨram otogham.”
049	EPH	005	032	Akar mogomer kam, a mɨngarir ekiam iti. Ezɨ kɨ uabɨ kamaghɨn nɨghnɨsi, a Krais uan sios ko aning geghari.
049	EPH	005	033	Ezɨ akar kam a uaghan ia mɨgɨa ghaze, ia gumaziba vaghvagh uarigh ifongezɨ moghɨn uan amuibagh ifongegh. Eghtɨ ia amuiba vaghvagh uan paba baghɨvɨra ikɨ.
049	EPH	006	001	Ia boriba, arazir aghuir ia damuamimra kara, ia Ekiam ko porogh uan ameboghfeziabar akaba baragh.
049	EPH	006	002	Godɨn Akɨnafarim ghaze, “Ia uan ameboghfeziabar apengan ikɨva men akabar gɨn mangɨ.” Akar Gavgavir kam, an Akar Gavgavibar tongɨn ikia, egha dar faraghavɨra akar dɨkɨrɨzim sara iti.
049	EPH	006	003	Akar dɨkɨrɨzir kam kamakɨn, “Ia kamaghɨn damutɨ, ian dabirabim bar deraghtɨ ia nguazir kam dughiar ruarimɨn an ikiam.”
049	EPH	006	004	Ia afeziaba, ia uan boribar nɨghnɨzibagh asɨghasɨgh me damutɨ, me ataran markɨ. Egh ia deravɨra men ganɨva Ekiamɨn damazimɨn men kuariba iniva men araziba akɨrɨva, Ekiamɨn arazibar men sure damu.
049	EPH	006	005	Ia ingangarir gumazamizir kɨniba, ia uan gumazir ekiar ian garibar men atiatingɨva, men akaba baraghɨva men apengan ikɨ. Egh ia ifaran kogh, navir zuruzimɨn ingangarim damu, mati ia Kraisɨn akam baragha an ingangarim gami.
049	EPH	006	006	Ia fo, ian gumazir ekiar ian gariba ian gan suam, ia ingangarim deravɨram a gamizɨ me ia gifonge. Egh ia kamaghɨn nɨghnɨghan markɨ, me ian garir dughiabara, ia ingangarir aghuim damuam. Puvatɨ. Ia Kraisɨn ingangarir gumazir kɨnibara, kamaghɨn ia God ifongezɨ moghɨn ia uan nɨghnɨziba bar da isɨ ingangarim danɨngɨva a damu.
049	EPH	006	007	Kamaghɨn ia ingangarir gumazamizir kɨnibar mɨn ingangarim damuva, ian naviba bar akongegh suam, e uan gumazir ekiar en gariba me baghavɨra ingangarim gamir puvatɨ, e Ekiam bagha ingangarim gami.
049	EPH	006	008	Ia ingangarir gumazamizir kɨnibar mɨn iti, o ia tavɨn apengan ingangarim gamir puvatɨziba, ia kamaghɨn fogh, gumazamizir ingangarir aghuibagh amiba, Ekiam da bagh ivezir aghuiba bar vaghvagh me danɨngam.
049	EPH	006	009	Kamaghɨra ia, men garir gumazir ekiaba, ia uaghan arazir aghuiba uan ingangarir gumazamizir kɨnibar amu. Ia atiatir araziba me damuan markɨ. Ia zurara bizir kam gɨnɨghnɨgh, ia ko ian ingangarir gumazir kɨniba, ia bar Gumazir Ekiar Ian Garir vamɨra iti, egha a uan Nguibamɨn pɨn iti. An arazir vamɨra gisɨn tugha gumazamiziba bar me tuisɨsi.
049	EPH	006	010	Nan mɨgɨrɨgɨar abuananaba, ezɨ kɨ kamaghɨn mɨkɨmasa, ia Ekiamɨn poroghtɨ an gavgavir ekiam ia damutɨ ia tuivigh gavgavigham.
049	EPH	006	011	God ia ganɨdir mɨdorozir biziba, ia bar dar aghuigh dar suikigh. Kamaghɨn ia tugh gavgavigh Satanɨn ifavarir nɨghnɨzir kuraba da munamangam.
049	EPH	006	012	Ia deravɨra nɨghnɨgh, e gumazamizir igharaziba ko uariv sozir puvatɨ. E duar kurar overiamɨn itiba ko uariv sosi. Duar gavgavir gumazamizibagh ativiba, ko aser gavgaviba itiba, ko nguazir kamɨn garir adariaba, duar kurar kaba dughiar mɨtater kamɨn aven ingarima e da ko uariv sosi.
049	EPH	006	013	Kamaghɨn ia God ia ganɨngizir mɨdorozir bizibar suigh dar aghuigh. Egh arazir kuraba otivamin dughiam, ia tugh gavgavigh uan apanim munasɨ, mangɨ mɨdorozim gɨvaghamin dughiam, ia tugh gavgavigh mamaghɨra ikiam.
049	EPH	006	014	Ia tugh gavgavighsɨ, Godɨn guizɨn akam letiamɨn mɨn uan ivariam gikegh. Egh arazir aghuir ia zuraram amiba evarimɨn pɨzir korotiamɨn mɨn anerugh.
049	EPH	006	015	Egh ia Akar Aghuim anekunsɨ zurara bar ifongegh, arazir kam mati ia dagarir asuabar mɨn da zui. Akar Aghuir kam kamakɨn, God e ko navir vamɨra ikiasa.
049	EPH	006	016	Egh dughiaba bar ia oramɨn mɨn nɨghnɨzir gavgavim uaghan an suiragh, eghtɨ gumazir kuram, Satan, a barir avim itiba ia gasavamangɨtɨ, ia orar kamɨn amodoghɨn barir avir kaba mungam.
049	EPH	006	017	Ia God ian akurazir arazim gɨnɨghnɨgh, egh nɨghnɨzir kam, dapanir asuar gavgavimɨn mɨn anerughtɨ a ian dapaniba avɨ. Egh Godɨn akam, an Duam ia ganɨngizir mɨdorozir sabamɨn mɨn ia an suiragh.
049	EPH	006	018	Ia bizir kabar amuva, egh God ko mɨkɨm. Egh a ian akurvaghsɨ ia an azangsɨgh. Ia zurara, Godɨn Duam ian navibagh inivtɨ, ia God ko mɨkɨm. Egh angamɨra ikɨ gan, egh dughiatam God ko mɨgeir arazim ataghɨraghan markɨ, egh zurara Godɨn gumazamiziba bar me bagh a ko mɨkɨm.
049	EPH	006	019	Egh ia uaghan na bagh God ko mɨkɨm suam, God uan akam na danightɨ, kɨ anekunsɨ, kɨ atiatingan koghɨva, bighɨvɨra mɨkɨmam. Egh Akar Aghuimɨn nɨghnɨzir mogomem aghuram.
049	EPH	006	020	Kɨ Akar Aghuim gumazamizir igharazibav kɨmasa, egha Krais Iesusɨn abuir gumazimɨn ikia, kamaghɨn kɨ datɨrɨghɨn kalabusɨn iti. Eghtɨ ia God ko mɨkɨm suam, kɨ an Akar Aghuimɨn gun mɨkɨmsɨ, a gavgavim na danightɨ, kɨ atiatingan koghɨva bighɨvɨra Akar Aghuim mɨkɨmam.
049	EPH	006	021	Tikikus, a mati en aveghbuar e bar ifongezim, a Ekiam baghavɨra ikiava an ingangarim gami. A na bativir bizibar gun ia mɨkɨmam. Eghtɨ ia fogham, kɨ manmaghɨn iti.
049	EPH	006	022	Ezɨ bizir kam bagha, kɨ ia bagha anemada. Kɨ ghaze, ia fogham, e manmaghɨn iti, eghtɨ akar kam gavgavim ian navibar amutɨ ia ua bar akuegham. Kamaghsua, kɨ Tikikus amadazɨ, a ia bagha zui.
049	EPH	006	023	Kɨ ia bagha God ko mɨgɨa ghaze, God en Afeziam ko en Ekiam Krais Iesus, aning navir amɨrizim ko igharaz darazigh ifongezir arazim, ko nɨghnɨzir gavgavim sara, Kraisɨn adarazi me danɨng.
049	EPH	006	024	Eghtɨ, gumazamizir en Ekiam Krais Iesus gifuegha mamaghɨra itiba, Godɨn apangkuvim bar me ko ikɨ.
