050	PHI	003	008	Kɨ Judan bizibara mɨgeir pu. Puvatɨ. Kɨ Krais Iesus gɨfo a nan Ekiam, ezɨ kɨ fofozir kam gɨnɨghnɨgha ghaze, a guizbangɨn bizim, ezɨ nguazir kamɨn biziba bar pura mɨneghmɨnezir kɨniba. Kɨ Kraisra gɨn mangasa ifonge. Egha bizir igharaziba bar da ategh, kɨ Kraisɨn suiragh,
